Act as a Senior Android Architect, Kotlin Multiplatform/Android Engineer, Jetpack Compose UI/UX Designer, and Software Testing Engineer.

Your responsibility is to design and implement a complete, professional-quality Android food delivery application called FoodFlow, inspired by the customer experiences of Swiggy, Zomato, EatSure and other modern food delivery platforms.

This application is being developed as a technical assessment for a Senior Android Developer position.

The project must demonstrate:

- Strong Kotlin programming skills.
- Advanced Android development knowledge.
- Clean Architecture.
- MVI architecture.
- Jetpack Compose.
- Offline-first architecture.
- Reliable local-to-remote data synchronization.
